ted figures to altered lighting or sounds. Stay alert and spot anything out of place while navigating the hotel corridor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/AnomaliesGIF.gif?t=1748707325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/extras/GameplayTextImage.png?t=1748707325\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spot anomalies and choose the right elevator to take.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No cheap jump scares. As long as you're paying attention...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hallway is small but the anomalies are numerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your time and examine every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach floor 8 and go to your room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Wibert"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641740/b9604985013addf83527d15346c10ab6b3f1d1c4/header.jpg?t=1748707325","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136639,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136639/movie480.mp4?t=1746661913","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136639/movie_max.mp4?t=1746661913"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136639/7edab8023361af3185d7c5636b34cfdb4aa8